{"id":"f93b15bd485d4a6109b8ea498c01a0cd5577f1e3","axis":"silent","repo":"microsoft/onnxruntime","sha":"f93b15bd485d4a6109b8ea498c01a0cd5577f1e3","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/Cuda_Runtime_Fusion.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,76 @@","+# CUDA runtime fusion","+","+## Unit-Swish kernel replacement","+","+The internal session entry `ep.cuda.runtime_fusion.unit_swish` enables the","+EP-owned replacement of standard unit-alpha Swish with an existing CUDA kernel.","+It is off by default and accepts only the exact strings `\"0\"` and `\"1\"`.","+The internal identifier remains `unit_swish_scaled_silu_v1`.","+","+The replacement maps standard ONNX Swish-24 with absent or FLOAT alpha=1 to the","+existing `com.microsoft.ScaledSiLU-1`, with alpha=1 and no scale input.","+Input and output must be dense, matching FLOAT or BF16 tensors with compatible","+shape and initializer metadata. FLOAT16, DOUBLE, mixed types, non-unit alpha,","+and nonfinite alpha are not admitted. No casts, schema changes, or target","+kernel changes are introduced.","+","+### Discovery and acceptance","+","+`cuda_runtime_fusion::Select` validates configuration and common admission gates,","+then delegates to `detail::SwishFusion::Discover`. Discovery finds candidates;","+the case-local `OfferSwish` constructs each capability and its deferred","+optimization callback. Constructing an offer does not modify the source graph.","+ORT invokes the callback only after checking that the selected region is","+available for assignment.","+","+Discovery requires a capability consumer that executes optimization callbacks,","+optimization level 2 or higher, ONNX-24/Microsoft-1 imports, an unfiltered main","+graph, normal CUDA layout, and no resource accountant. Minimal CUDA,","+contrib-disabled, and plugin CUDA builds do not offer this optimization.","+ORT-format loading does not execute these callbacks and opts out.","+","+Discovery reads metadata only, including for initializer inputs: it does not","+open external files or inspect tensor payloads. A scratch graph probes the","+exact typed target kernel. A missing target leaves ordinary execution eligible.","+Symbolic, anonymous, scalar, and empty shapes are eligible. Known element counts","+must fit the target's 256-thread grid with a signed-int block count; unknown","+extents remain subject to runtime kernel validation.","+","+Acceptance revalidates the live source, assignment, attributes, NodeArg","+identities, and owned type/shape snapshot. `rewrite::PatternRewriter::Run` is","+restricted to the original single-node region; the callback checks that it","+performed exactly one rewrite to one target. This standalone implementation","+uses the existing region-scoped `Run` API and does not depend on the","+stateful CausalConv fusion implementation.","+The original input and output NodeArgs, external fanout, and graph outputs","+are preserved. Stale offers fail rather than silently selecting another source.","+Changing an input's producer alone does not invalidate its NodeArg snapshot.","+","+### Numerical scope and tests","+","+At unit alpha, the source CUDA Sigmoid computes in FLOAT before converting to","+the element type, and the element product converts back to that type. The","+target also evaluates its stable sigmoid in FLOAT, with element conversions.","+Non-unit alpha is not covered.","+","+Focused source/fused/direct tests require identical non-NaN bits (including","+signed zero) and matching NaN classifications, not matching NaN payloads.","+They cover scalar, empty, odd, dynamic, and model-shaped inputs. FLOAT cases","+use pinned special values and seeded random raw bits. BF16 coverage includes","+all 65536 bit patterns in one rank-1 case; other shapes use pinned special","+values and seeded random bits. Graph and profile assertions verify CUDA","+placement and the replacement; values alone are insufficient evidence.","+These tests are not a guarantee for every input, shape, dtype, device, model,","+or performance regime.","+","+Run freshly built tests from the build directory:","+","+```sh","+./onnxruntime_test_all --gtest_filter='UnitSwishHostTest.*'","+./onnxruntime_provider_test --gtest_filter='CudaRuntimeFusionTest.UnitSwish*'","+```","+","+Confirm nonzero counts and inspect skips. CUDA numerical tests require a","+supported device; BF16 tests check device support before constructing test","+fixtures. Qualification logs, model counts, and hardware timings belong in","+validation artifacts rather than this contract."],"additions":76,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/optimizer/cuda_runtime_fusion.cc","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,59 @@","+// Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.","+// Licensed under the MIT License.","+","+#include \"core/optimizer/cuda_runtime_fusion_internal.h\"","+","+#if !defined(ORT_MINIMAL_BUILD) && !defined(DISABLE_CONTRIB_OPS)","+","+#include \"core/graph/graph_viewer.h\"","+","+namespace onnxruntime::cuda_runtime_fusion {","+namespace detail {","+","+Status ProbeTarget(Graph& graph, const rewrite::Replacement& recipe,","+                   const rewrite::Replacement::TensorBindings& bindings,","+                   const NodeAttributes& attributes, size_t output_count,","+                   const IExecutionProvider::IKernelLookup& lookup, bool& available) {","+  rewrite::Replacement::Instantiation instantiated;","+  ORT_RETURN_IF_ERROR(recipe.Instantiate(graph, bindings, attributes, instantiated));","+  ORT_RETURN_IF_NOT(instantiated.nodes.size() == 1 && instantiated.outputs.size() == output_count,","+                    \"CUDA runtime fusion target recipe must emit one node with the expected outputs.\");","+  InlinedVector<const NodeArg*> outputs(instantiated.outputs.begin(), instantiated.outputs.end());","+  graph.SetOutputs(outputs);","+  ORT_RETURN_IF_ERROR(graph.Resolve());","+  available = lookup.LookUpKernel(*graph.GetNode(instantiated.nodes.front())) != nullptr;","+  return Status::OK();","+}","+","+std::unique_ptr<ComputeCapability> MakeCapability(gsl::span<const NodeIndex> source_ids,","+                                                  OptimizationFunction optimization_func) {","+  auto subgraph = std::make_unique<IndexedSubGraph>();","+  subgraph->nodes.assign(source_ids.begin(), source_ids.end());","+  auto parent = std::make_unique<ComputeCapability>(std::move(subgraph));","+  auto optimization = std::make_unique<ComputeCapability>(std::make_unique<IndexedSubGraph>());","+  optimization->sub_graph->nodes.assign(source_ids.begin(), source_ids.end());","+  optimization->optimization_func = std::move(optimization_func);","+  parent->nodes_to_optimize.push_back(std::move(optimization));","+  return parent;","+}","+","+}  // namespace detail","+","+Status Select(const GraphViewer& viewer, const IExecutionProvider::IKernelLookup& kernel_lookup,","+              const GraphOptimizerRegistry& registry, const std::string& rule_id,","+              std::vector<std::unique_ptr<ComputeCapability>>& capabilities) {","+  ORT_RETURN_IF_NOT(capabilities.empty(), \"CUDA runtime fusion requires initially empty output.\");","+  ORT_RETURN_IF_NOT(rule_id == kUnitSwishRule,","+                    \"Unknown CUDA runtime fusion rule: \", rule_id);","+  const auto* config = kUnitSwishConfig;","+  const auto setting = registry.GetSessionOptions().config_options.GetConfigOrDefault(config, \"0\");","+  ORT_RETURN_IF_NOT(setting == \"0\" || setting == \"1\", config, \" must be exactly 0 or 1.\");","+  if (!registry.SupportsCapabilityOptimizations()) return Status::OK();","+  if (registry.GetSessionOptions().graph_optimization_level < TransformerLevel::Level2) return Status::OK();","+  if (setting == \"0\" || viewer.GetFilterInfo() || viewer.IsSubgraph()) return Status::OK();","+  return detail::SwishFusion::Discover(viewer, kernel_lookup, *registry.GetLogger(), capabilities);","+}","+","+}  // namespace onnxruntime::cuda_runtime_fusion","+","+#endif"],"additions":59,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/optimizer/cuda_runtime_fusion.h","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@","+// Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.","+// Licensed under the MIT License.","+#pragma once","+","+#include <memory>","+#include <string>","+#include <vector>","+","+#include \"core/framework/execution_provider.h\"","+#include \"core/optimizer/graph_optimizer_registry.h\"","+","+namespace onnxruntime::cuda_runtime_fusion {","+","+inline constexpr char kUnitSwishConfig[] = \"ep.cuda.runtime_fusion.unit_swish\";","+inline constexpr char kUnitSwishRule[] = \"unit_swish_scaled_silu_v1\";","+","+// Read-only discovery. Requires empty output; publishes capabilities only on success.","+Status Select(const GraphViewer& graph, const IExecutionProvider::IKernelLookup& kernel_lookup,","+              const GraphOptimizerRegistry& registry, const std::string& rule_id,","+              std::vector<std::unique_ptr<ComputeCapability>>& capabilities);","+","+}  // namespace onnxruntime::cuda_runtime_fusion"],"additions":22,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/optimizer/cuda_runtime_fusion_internal.h","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@","+// Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.","+// Licensed under the MIT License.","+#pragma once","+","+#include \"core/optimizer/cuda_runtime_fusion.h\"","+","+#if !defined(ORT_MINIMAL_BUILD) && !defined(DISABLE_CONTRIB_OPS)","+","+#include <functional>","+","+#include \"core/framework/compute_capability.h\"","+#include \"core/optimizer/pattern_rewriter.h\"","+","+namespace onnxruntime::cuda_runtime_fusion::detail {","+","+class SwishFusion {","+ public:","+  static Status Discover(const GraphViewer& viewer, const IExecutionProvider::IKernelLookup& lookup,","+                         const logging::Logger& logger,","+                         std::vector<std::unique_ptr<ComputeCapability>>& capabilities);","+","+ private:","+  SwishFusion() = delete;","+  ORT_DISALLOW_COPY_ASSIGNMENT_AND_MOVE(SwishFusion);","+};","+","+Status ProbeTarget(Graph& graph, const rewrite::Replacement& recipe,","+                   const rewrite::Replacement::TensorBindings& bindings,","+                   const NodeAttributes& attributes, size_t output_count,","+                   const IExecutionProvider::IKernelLookup& lookup, bool& available);","+","+using OptimizationFunction =","+    std::function<Status(Graph&, const ComputeCapability&, ComputeCapability&, const GraphOptimizerRegistry&)>;","+","+// Construct the offered region and callback holder without interpreting or rewriting the candidate.","+std::unique_ptr<ComputeCapability> MakeCapability(gsl::span<const NodeIndex> source_ids,","+                                                  OptimizationFunction optimization_func);","+","+}  // namespace onnxruntime::cuda_runtime_fusion::detail","+","+#endif"],"additions":41,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/optimizer/cuda_runtime_fusion_swish.cc","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,233 @@","+// Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.","+// Licensed under the MIT License.","+","+#include \"core/optimizer/cuda_runtime_fusion_internal.h\"","+","+#if !defined(ORT_MINIMAL_BUILD) && !defined(DISABLE_CONTRIB_OPS)","+","+#include <algorithm>","+#include <cmath>","+#include <limits>","+#include \"core/framework/compute_capability.h\"","+#include \"core/graph/graph_viewer.h\"","+#include \"core/graph/model.h\"","+#include \"core/optimizer/pattern_rewriter.h\"","+","+namespace onnxruntime::cuda_runtime_fusion::detail {","+namespace {","+using namespace rewrite;","+bool Type(const NodeArg* value, int expected, bool required) {","+  const auto* type = value->TypeAsProto();","+  if (!type || !type->has_tensor_type()) return !required && !type;","+  const int element = type->tensor_type().elem_type();","+  return element == expected || (!required && element == 0);","+}","+","+constexpr char kUnitSwishPattern[] = R\"(pattern UnitSwish(x) { y=Swish(x); return y })\";","+constexpr char kUnitSwishReplacement[] = R\"((x)=>{ y=com.microsoft.ScaledSiLU(x,alpha=1.0); return y })\";","+","+// Own metadata values. Graph-owned pointers are identity tokens, never dereferenced.","+// Acceptance must use the original live graph and fetch its current source by index.","+struct UnitSwishSnapshot {","+  const Node* node = nullptr;","+  const NodeArg* input = nullptr;","+  const NodeArg* output = nullptr;","+  std::string input_name;","+  std::string output_name;","+  std::string name;","+  std::string domain;","+  std::string overload;","+  int version = 0;","+  std::string input_type;","+  std::string output_type;","+  InlinedVector<std::pair<std::string, std::string>> attributes;","+","+  bool operator==(const UnitSwishSnapshot& other) const {","+    return node == other.node && input == other.input && output == other.output &&","+           input_name == other.input_name && output_name == other.output_name &&","+           name == other.name && domain == other.domain && overload == other.overload && version == other.version &&","+           input_type == other.input_type && output_type == other.output_type && attributes == other.attributes;","+  }","+};","+","+// No payload inspection, including for initializer inputs. Zero extents annihilate the","+// product before multiplication; unknown extents do not invent a runtime size.","+bool UnitSwishShape(const ONNX_NAMESPACE::TensorShapeProto* shape) {","+  if (!shape) return true;","+  bool unknown = false;","+  bool zero = false;","+  for (const auto& dim : shape->dim()) {","+    if (!dim.has_dim_value())","+      unknown = true;","+    else if (dim.dim_value() < 0)","+      return false;","+    else if (dim.dim_value() == 0)","+      zero = true;","+  }","+  if (zero || unknown) return true;","+  // Mirrors LaunchScaledSiLU in scaled_silu_impl.cu: 256 threads and an int block count.","+  constexpr int64_t max_count = int64_t{256} * std::numeric_limits<int>::max();","+  int64_t count = 1;","+  for (const auto& dim : shape->dim()) {","+    if (dim.dim_value() > max_count / count) return false;","+    count *= dim.dim_value();","+  }","+  return true;","+}","+","+// Read live metadata only; discovery and acceptance must use the same complete check.","+bool UnitSwishSemantics(const Graph& graph, const Match& match, UnitSwishSnapshot* snapshot) {","+  const auto& imports = graph.DomainToVersionMap();","+  if (!imports.count(kOnnxDomain) || imports.at(kOnnxDomain) != 24 ||","+      !imports.count(kMSDomain) || imports.at(kMSDomain) != 1 || match.nodes.size() != 1) return false;","+  const auto* node = *match.nodes.begin();","+  if (node->OpType() != \"Swish\" || node->Domain() != kOnnxDomain || node->SinceVersion() != 24 ||","+      !node->Overload().empty() || !node->GetExecutionProviderType().empty() || node->InputDefs().size() != 1 ||","+      node->OutputDefs().size() != 1) return false;","+  const auto* input = match.valueOf(\"x\");","+  const auto* output = match.valueOf(\"y\");","+  if (!input || !output || !input->Exists() || !output->Exists()) return false;","+  const auto* input_type = input->TypeAsProto();","+  if (!input_type || !input_type->has_tensor_type()) return false;","+  const int type = input_type->tensor_type().elem_type();","+  if (type != ONNX_NAMESPACE::TensorProto_DataType_FLOAT &&","+      type != ONNX_NAMESPACE::TensorProto_DataType_BFLOAT16) return false;","+  if (!Type(input, type, true) || !Type(output, type, true) ||","+      !UnitSwishShape(input->Shape()) || !UnitSwishShape(output->Shape())) return false;","+#if !defined(DISABLE_SPARSE_TENSORS)","+  if (graph.IsSparseInitializer(input->Name())) return false;","+#endif","+  if (const auto* tensor = graph.GetConstantInitializer(input->Name(), false)) {","+    if (tensor->data_type() != type) return false;","+    ONNX_NAMESPACE::TensorShapeProto initializer_shape;","+    for (auto dim : tensor->dims()) initializer_shape.add_dim()->set_dim_value(dim);","+    if (!UnitSwishShape(&initializer_shape)) return false;","+    for (const auto* value : {input, output}) {","+      if (const auto* shape = value->Shape()) {","+        if (shape->dim_size() != tensor->dims_size()) return false;","+        for (int i = 0; i < shape->dim_size(); ++i) {","+          if (shape->dim(i).has_dim_value() && shape->dim(i).dim_value() != tensor->dims(i)) return false;","+        }","+      }","+    }","+  }","+  const auto* in_shape = input->Shape();","+  const auto* out_shape = output->Shape();","+  if (in_shape && out_shape) {","+    if (in_shape->dim_size() != out_shape->dim_size()) return false;","+    for (int i = 0; i < in_shape->dim_size(); ++i) {","+      const auto& a = in_shape->dim(i);","+      const auto& b = out_shape->dim(i);","+      if (a.has_dim_value() && b.has_dim_value() && a.dim_value() != b.dim_value()) return false;","+    }","+  }","+  UnitSwishSnapshot actual;","+  for (const auto& [name, attr] : node->GetAttributes()) {","+    if (name != \"alpha\" || attr.type() != ONNX_NAMESPACE::AttributeProto_AttributeType_FLOAT ||","+        !std::isfinite(attr.f()) || attr.f() != 1.0f) return false;","+    actual.attributes.emplace_back(name, attr.SerializeAsString());","+  }","+  std::sort(actual.attributes.begin(), actual.attributes.end());","+  actual.node = node;","+  actual.input = input;","+  actual.output = output;","+  actual.input_name = input->Name();","+  actual.output_name = output->Name();","+  actual.name = node->Name();","+  actual.domain = node->Domain();","+  actual.overload = node->Overload();","+  actual.version = node->SinceVersion();","+  actual.input_type = input->TypeAsProto()->SerializeAsString();","+  actual.output_type = output->TypeAsProto()->SerializeAsString();","+  if (snapshot) *snapshot = std::move(actual);","+  return true;","+}","+","+Status UnitSwishTargetAvailable(const Match& match, const Replacement& recipe,","+                                const IExecutionProvider::IKernelLookup& lookup,","+                                const logging::Logger& logger, bool& available) {","+  Model scratch(\"cuda_unit_swish_probe\", false, ModelMetaData(), PathString(),","+                IOnnxRuntimeOpSchemaRegistryList(), {{kOnnxDomain, 24}, {kMSDomain, 1}}, {}, logger);","+  auto& graph = scratch.MainGraph();","+  auto& input = graph.GetOrCreateNodeArg(\"x\", match.valueOf(\"x\")->TypeAsProto());","+  graph.SetInputs({&input});","+  return ProbeTarget(graph, recipe, {{\"x\", &input}}, {}, 1, lookup, available);","+}","+","+std::unique_ptr<ComputeCapability> OfferSwish(NodeIndex anchor, UnitSwishSnapshot snapshot,","+                                              const Pattern& pattern, const Replacement& recipe) {","+  Options options;","+  options.compatible_execution_providers.clear();","+  Rules rules;","+  auto predicate = [snapshot](const Graph& graph, Match& candidate) {","+    UnitSwishSnapshot actual;","+    return UnitSwishSemantics(graph, candidate, &actual) && actual == snapshot;","+  };","+  rules.emplace_back(kUnitSwishRule, pattern, recipe, std::move(predicate),","+                     InlinedVector<OpsetRequirement, 1>{{kOnnxDomain, 24, 24}, {kMSDomain, 1, 1}});","+  auto rewriter = std::make_shared<const PatternRewriter>(std::move(rules), std::move(options));","+  const InlinedVector<NodeIndex> source_ids{anchor};","+  OptimizationFunction optimization_func =","+      [rewriter, anchor, snapshot](Graph& graph, const ComputeCapability& selected, ComputeCapability& capability,","+                                   const GraphOptimizerRegistry&) -> Status {","+    ORT_RETURN_IF_NOT(selected.sub_graph && capability.sub_graph &&","+                          selected.sub_graph->nodes.size() == 1 && selected.sub_graph->nodes[0] == anchor &&","+                          capability.sub_graph->nodes.size() == 1 && capability.sub_graph->nodes[0] == anchor,","+                      \"Unit Swish selected region changed.\");","+    const auto* source = graph.GetNode(anchor);","+    ORT_RETURN_IF_NOT(source && source == snapshot.node && source->GetExecutionProviderType().empty(),","+                      \"Unit Swish source is missing or already assigned.\");","+    InlinedHashSet<NodeIndex> region{anchor};","+    Statistics statistics;","+    ORT_RETURN_IF_ERROR(rewriter->Run(graph, statistics, region));","+    ORT_RETURN_IF_NOT(statistics.rewrites == 1 && region.size() == 1,","+                      \"Unit Swish must rewrite exactly once to one node.\");","+    const auto* target = graph.GetNode(*region.begin());","+    ORT_RETURN_IF_NOT(target && target->Domain() == kMSDomain && target->OpType() == \"ScaledSiLU\" &&","+                          target->InputDefs().size() == 1 && target->InputDefs()[0] == snapshot.input &&","+                          target->OutputDefs().size() == 1 && target->OutputDefs()[0] == snapshot.output,","+                      \"Unit Swish did not preserve input/output identities.\");","+    ORT_RETURN_IF_ERROR(graph.Resolve());","+    ORT_RETURN_IF_NOT(target->InputDefs()[0] == snapshot.input && target->OutputDefs()[0] == snapshot.output &&","+                          graph.GetNodeArg(snapshot.output_name) == snapshot.output,","+                      \"Unit Swish final input/output identities changed.\");","+    capability.sub_graph->nodes.assign(region.begin(), region.end());","+    return Status::OK();","+  };","+  return MakeCapability(source_ids, std::move(optimization_func));","+}","+","+}  // namespace","+","+Status SwishFusion::Discover(const GraphViewer& viewer, const IExecutionProvider::IKernelLookup& lookup,","+                             const logging::Logger& logger,","+                             std::vector<std::unique_ptr<ComputeCapability>>& capabilities) {","+  const auto& graph = viewer.GetGraph();","+  const auto& imports = graph.DomainToVersionMap();","+  if (!imports.count(kOnnxDomain) || imports.at(kOnnxDomain) != 24 ||","+      !imports.count(kMSDomain) || imports.at(kMSDomain) != 1) return Status::OK();","+  ORT_RETURN_IF(graph.GraphResolveNeeded(), \"CUDA runtime fusion requires a resolved graph.\");","+  const Pattern pattern = PatternLibrary(kUnitSwishPattern).GetPattern(\"UnitSwish\");","+  const Replacement recipe(kUnitSwishReplacement);","+  std::vector<std::unique_ptr<ComputeCapability>> pending;","+  for (auto anchor : viewer.GetNodesInTopologicalOrder()) {","+    const auto* node = graph.GetNode(anchor);","+    if (!node || node->OpType() != \"Swish\") continue;","+    Status probe_status;","+    ORT_RETURN_IF_ERROR(pattern.VisitMatches(graph, anchor, [&](Match& match) {","+      UnitSwishSnapshot snapshot;","+      if (!UnitSwishSemantics(graph, match, &snapshot)) return true;","+      bool available = false;","+      probe_status = UnitSwishTargetAvailable(match, recipe, lookup, logger, available);","+      if (!probe_status.IsOK()) return false;","+      if (available) pending.push_back(OfferSwish(anchor, std::move(snapshot), pattern, recipe));","+      return true;","+    }));","+    ORT_RETURN_IF_ERROR(probe_status);","+  }","+  capabilities = std::move(pending);","+  return Status::OK();","+}","+}  // namespace onnxruntime::cuda_runtime_fusion::detail","+","+#endif"],"additions":233,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"onnxruntime/core/optimizer/graph_optimizer_registry.cc","lines":["@@ -13,9 +13,12 @@ namespace onnxruntime {"," #if !defined(ORT_MINIMAL_BUILD)"," GraphOptimizerRegistry::GraphOptimizerRegistry(const onnxruntime::SessionOptions* sess_options,","                                                const onnxruntime::IExecutionProvider* cpu_ep,","-                                               const logging::Logger* logger) : session_options_(sess_options),","-                                                                                cpu_ep_(cpu_ep),","-                                                                                logger_(logger) {","+                                               const logging::Logg